WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.520
Come on!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:16.630
Is that all you've got?

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.890
What is this?

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.570
It's a shame since we've just met, but...

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.040
It'll be OK, right?

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.010
My lord... Akerin...

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:13.940
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:13.940
<b>Saigoku Maiden</b>

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:21.820
It's the sea! The sea!

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.460
It's so cold!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.680
Yay! Yay!

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.850
Don't run around too much!

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.080
You're still recovering!

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.880
But I haven't been to the sea in ages!

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:36.800
My lord!

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.970
There's a big sea shell!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.270
What's wrong, Mitsuhide?

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.580
Sure you aren't sick?

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.400
No, my lord...

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:59.900
It's nothing.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.330
You don't look good, Akerin.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:05.500
Are you hungry?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.200
You're the one who's hungry.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.710
She can tell, Hideyoshi!

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:16.380
You know, I don't always talk about food.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.950
That's right.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:20.790
I'd say you only mention food 
ten times a day or so.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.340
That's mean!

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.980
Hey, Akerin!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:35.430
What kind of people are we going to meet?

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.930
What do you mean?

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:41.360
You only gave me their names, you know!

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.910
If you don't know, then I shall tell you!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:54.960
Born in Katsurahama and boasting 
a trained, muscular body!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.910
With a red helm and demon's mask,

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:02.490
unmatched might, and a giant axe!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:08.970
I am none other than Chousokabe Motochika!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:16.480
Next up, I am a Higo-born warrior, 
with beautiful blond hair,

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:21.890
an angel's smile, and a demon's temper.

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:24.360
Underestimate me, and you'll regret it!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:29.820
With her Don Frankie Cannon, Ootomo Sourin is here!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:37.790
Finally, I was born and raised by Miyashima, in Aki.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:43.050
With elegant eyes, beauty, and talent,

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:46.510
I'm known throughout the land 
for my skill as a general.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:50.850
Master of blade and brush, 
my name is Mouri Motonari!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.810
We are the Saigoku Three!

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.850
<i>Cruel Blade!</i>

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:05.110
Morons.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.510
Great. You three are all together.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.910
I won't have to find each of you individually.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.570
You look good down there. You really do.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:25.340
This whole introduction thing was your idea!

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:26.830
That's mean!

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:28.720
You guys both thought it was a good idea!

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.850
You said they'd be too stunned to move!

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.870
In a way that was true, yes.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.890
My eyes were dots!

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:40.100
Let's get to the point.

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:42.960
I want your pieces of the Crimson Armor.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.210
I refuse.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:52.790
OK!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.920
What?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.350
I see.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:24.940
The Crimson Armor is inside that 
fishing hut, within a wooden chest.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.450
Mitsuhide, go get it.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.040
Y-Yes.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.670
Hey, my lord...

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.010
Akerin doesn't look so good.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:41.990
Should I go, too?

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.130
No, don't worry.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:48.150
Mitsuhide is a master of strategy and deception...

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:52.770
Which means that she can see through them.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:56.360
Were you to go, it would 
make things more dangerous,

00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:58.480
for both of you.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.850
How mean!

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:03.770
My lord, that's rude.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:29.560
<i>Even Hideyoshi could have retrieved a box.</i>

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:32.270
<i>Why did my lord send me?</i>

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:39.320
<i>Did she send me here</i>

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:42.980
<i>because she wishes to be alone with Hideyoshi?</i>

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:46.780
<i>No... That can't be!</i>

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.940
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:57.740
I have returned.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.380
Let me see.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.080
Now, what's inside...

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:05.790
My lord!

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.240
Lord...

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.320
Damn you...

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:17.510
You're fortunate.

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:22.520
But did Akechi-dono not notice this trap?

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:27.150
You

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:34.750
will pay for that!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.770
Hideyoshi!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.120
My lord!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.090
Akerin!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.300
Hideyoshi!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.080
We're taking the girl.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:58.470
If you want her back, 
come to the top of that mountain!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:03.100
And ready the Crimson Armor, too.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.150
OK!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.610
See you!

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.350
My lord, are you safe...

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.240
Wait!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.940
That's what you get for doing this to us!

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:01.290
If you want us to stop,

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:04.240
reveal Mitsuhide and Nobunaga's weaknesses!

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:05.850
I don't know!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.040
I don't know!

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:12.540
I see... Nobunaga and Mitsuhide 
have come to the mountain.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:21.050
I see. So Mitsuhide...

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.300
Motochika! Sourin!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.310
I've decided on our plan.

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.400
I'm terribly sorry, my lord.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.630
If only I'd checked that box more closely...

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:41.440
If you regret it...

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:45.020
If you feel that way,

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.080
show me through your actions.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:49.920
That is all.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.820
Yes, my lord.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.020
My lord...

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:13.610
What is this?

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:17.900
That's a pretty big trap.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:23.390
Looks like they're trying to separate us.

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:26.330
We'll have to go along with it.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.230
But...

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:28.750
Don't worry.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.200
I'm going on ahead.

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:44.430
It worked.

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.760
Now we follow the plan.

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:47.810
OK!

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.770
<i>My lord...</i>

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:01.190
<i>Has my lord abandoned me?</i>

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:08.420
<i>Does my lord prefer Hideyoshi to me?</i>

00:12:08.420 --> 00:12:10.050
<i>Am I no longer...</i>

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.340
Welcome, Mitsuhide-san!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.450
Sourin!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.390
Motochika!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.140
Akerin!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.370
Save me!

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Two against one isn't my favorite way to do things.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.610
Sorry. But I must defeat you.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:36.300
Or will you surrender?

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:36.900
Hell, no.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.510
Fantastic!

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:42.110
Otherwise, we wouldn't have gotten to have any fun!

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:52.650
It's begun.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.470
Then we should start, as well.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.380
Oda Nobunaga-dono...

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:03.360
Just you?

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.500
Unsatisfied?

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.970
No, but...

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:09.560
But?

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:14.730
Do you really believe you can beat me alone?

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.730
Of course!

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:21.780
Then show me!

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:28.570
What is this?

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:32.210
What did you do?

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:35.350
Don't worry.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.320
It's not poison.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.780
It's merely an anesthetic.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:44.660
I just let the wind carry it.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:46.680
I see...

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.220
Then you used the fog so I wouldn't notice it?

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.730
That's right.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:02.850
It's a shame since we've just met, but...

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.740
Come on, come on!

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:29.090
Is that all you've got?

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:34.430
This must be why Nobunaga-san got sick of you!

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.480
<i>The triple-soul claw told me</i>

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:46.860
of Mitsuhide's doubts about Nobunaga,

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.310
and about her jealousy of Hideyoshi.

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:50.910
Then if we use that...

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.370
It will be easy!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:57.060
Life's a funny thing, ain't it?

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.470
You serve for years, and in an instant, your place vanishes.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.390
Shut up!

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:03.510
I guess she prefers someone fun and cute

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:05.750
over someone who acts smart but is useless.

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.050
You've been dumped.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:14.300
Shut up!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:17.860
You're wide-open!

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.110
This is it!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:29.400
What?

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.990
What's going on?

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.680
It'll be OK, right?

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.990
My lord... Akerin...

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.080
She got away?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.380
Seems that way.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.850
She's tougher than she looks.

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.990
But she's gotta be hurt.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:50.710
We're almost done here.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:51.590
Yeah.

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:03.970
<i>I've served my lord faithfully.</i>

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:08.310
<i>I always thought that if I could be of use to her,</i>

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:10.110
<i>that would be enough.</i>

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:18.500
<i>But am I being selfish, 
wishing to remain the one closest to her?</i>

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.710
<i>No.</i>

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:27.520
My light...

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:33.470
How can you move?

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.390
You overestimate yourself!

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.140
You've angered me.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.760
You took me by surprise and stole Hideyoshi,

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:49.230
and you've made Mitsuhide doubt herself.

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:53.210
Even so... Even so...

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:59.240
Neither my retainers nor I 
are as weak as you believe!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.350
<i>Cruel Blade!</i>

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:14.180
Where'd she go?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.140
She ran?

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.190
Without taking the Crimson Armor?

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:17.930
Probably.

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:21.270
We'll keep looking, and if we can't 
find her, we'll go meet Motonari.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:33.730
There!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.030
Motochika!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.250
This mountain is an interesting place.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:48.250
I've made some adjustments to your traps.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:53.920
First one.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.380
Sourin, move!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:06.190
Now you're inside a trap I've altered.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:12.410
When cut, one of those wires 
defuses all the traps.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:17.200
Of course, if you guess wrong, they'll all go off.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:18.620
Well?

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:20.120
Care to test your luck?

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:23.160
If you've got the guts...

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.870
Don't mess with us!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.040
Yeah, that was a lie.

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:39.930
So this is a foreign cannon?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:44.700
Hey, don't touch my Don Frankie Cannon!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:49.350
Excellent. I've always wanted
to shoot one of these.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.270
Since I'm useless...

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:57.400
...forgive me if I mess up and hurt you.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.830
No one's coming...

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.530
I'm scared...

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.640
Akerin!

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:21.970
I'm so glad you're safe...

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:25.130
Um... Can you undo this?

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.190
It hurts all over...

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.810
Thanks, Akerin.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:37.860
But I'd have preferred if 
you could've done it more gently.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.290
Akerin?

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.660
You surprised me!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:53.140
You looked really scary!

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:55.000
But you saved me!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.600
Thank you, Akerin!

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:59.170
I didn't do it for you.

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:02.220
<i>I defeated Motochika and Sourin,</i>

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.290
<i>saved Hideyoshi, and got the armor.</i>

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:11.060
<i>Now my lord will like me again!</i>

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:14.060
<i>More than her...</i>

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:22.910
My lord!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.750
I was scared.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.180
I was so scared...

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:33.630
I see... I'm sorry, Hideyoshi.

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:37.840
Is that their armor?

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:40.380
You did it, Hideyoshi!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:44.560
I didn't do anything... Akerin did!

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.200
I see.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.260
Well done, Mitsuhide!

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:52.640
No... It's my honor...

00:20:56.530 --> 00:21:00.530
<i>Yes... It's my honor...</i>

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.790
At last, she has all the armor?

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:16.590
It's finally time...

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:23.240
Time for me to take the armor.

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:29.640
We've finally gathered all the armor, my lord.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.800
Yes.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:34.840
Now I can achieve my dream of conquest!

00:21:34.840 --> 00:21:36.520
It's an amazing dream, isn't it?

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.740
<i>Is that not enough?</i>

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:40.830
<i>Is it still lacking?</i>

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:46.030
<i>Or is it too late for me?</i>

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:50.170
<i>If it is...</i>

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:51.910
<i>I...</i>

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.080
<i>I...</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:52.240
<b>Sengoku Otome Style Preview</b>

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:29.400
<b>Counseling</b>

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:27.760
It's time for student counseling today.

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:28.360
Yes.

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:33.570
Are you the type who says what she thinks, Hide-san?

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:33.430
<b>Date-Sensei 
Hirata Yuka</b>

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:33.430
<b>Hideyoshino 
Hidaka Rina</b>

00:23:33.570 --> 00:23:36.000
Yes. Yes, I suppose I am.

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:36.830
Are you?

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:37.320
Yes.

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:40.810
So, let's say your friend is having love trouble.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:52.240
<b>A Friend's Love</b>

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:41.460
OK.

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:44.170
Let's say she's fallen for a guy who's clearly bad for her.

00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:44.660
Right.

00:23:44.660 --> 00:23:48.040
Would you still support her?

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:51.580
Or could you say, "No, that guy's bad for you"?

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.400
Watch next time, OK?

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:56.770
Preview

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:56.770
Double Suicide Maiden
